  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/misc4/). VERDICT: PARTLY-STALE. 2026-11-01 review @100b6fbb6e: on a Kafka + Redis fixture, both event_publishes edges had channel=='topic' ('orders'/'orders', 'alerts'/'alerts'). message_queue.py:577-593 passes channel=join.channel and topic=join.value. The 103/103 self-corpus count is stale: those edges came from test files (drained by WI-nitob), and today's packages/ self-analysis has 0 event_publishes edges. MECHANISM: Edge.create(channel=join.channel) and meta.topic=join.value receive the same resolved string."  # c0ce
